msgstr "伤害与力度"

msgid "Declare another archetype in the type file shown, as a copy of the one selected (else the first plain one) under a name nobody holds yet; give it its real name and box in the selection. Undo takes it back"
msgstr "在显示的类型文件中再声明一个原型，作为所选原型（未选择时为第一个普通原型）的副本，名称为尚无人使用的名称；在所选内容中为其指定真实名称和边界框。“撤消”可将其撤回"

msgid "Did again: {what}"
msgstr "已重做：{what}"

msgid "Display on the HUD"
msgstr "在 HUD 上显示"

msgid "Drag to orbit · Shift+drag to pan · Click to select · Alt+click for a model"
msgstr "拖动以环绕 · Shift+拖动以平移 · 单击以选择 · Alt+单击以选择模型"

msgid "Drawable Texture"
msgstr "Drawable 纹理"

msgid "Drawable dictionary"
msgstr "Drawable 字典"

msgid "Drivers:"
msgstr "驱动器："

msgid "Drop .ypt files: OpenRage keeps each as rules and textures you can read and change, checks the pack and builds a FiveM resource."
msgstr "拖放 .ypt 文件：OpenRage 会将每个文件保存为可阅读和修改的规则与纹理，检查该包并构建 FiveM 资源。"

msgid "Drop map files here"
msgstr "将地图文件拖放到此处"

msgid "Drop particle files here"
msgstr "将粒子文件拖放到此处"

msgid "Drop weapon models, textures and weapon files: OpenRage reads what they define, checks the pack and builds a FiveM resource."
msgstr "拖放武器模型、纹理和武器文件：OpenRage 会读取它们的定义，检查该包并构建 FiveM 资源。"

msgid "Drop weapons here"
msgstr "将武器拖放到此处"

msgid "Each .ypt file becomes a source of the pack, its effects as rules and its textures as DDS files"
msgstr "每个 .ypt 文件都会成为该包的一个源，其效果保存为规则，其纹理保存为 DDS 文件"

msgid "Each file becomes a source of the pack and joins the map set shown"
msgstr "每个文件都会成为该包的一个源，并加入显示的地图集合"

msgid "Each file becomes a source of the pack, and the weapons a weapon file defines join it"
msgstr "每个文件都会成为该包的一个源，武器文件定义的武器也会加入该包"

