msgid "GTA VI's library holds no structure {name}, so the whole document is untyped and kept as text."
msgstr "GTA VI 的库中没有结构 {name}，因此整个文档无类型，并以文本保留。"

msgid "Give the project maps: an empty pack in a folder of its own, shipped by every build, and the Map screen to fill it. Add map files… puts files into a pack that is there"
msgstr "为项目添加地图：在单独的文件夹中创建一个空包，每次构建都会包含它，并提供“地图”界面来填充。“添加地图文件…”会将文件放入已有的包中"

msgid "Give the project particle effects: an empty pack in a folder of its own, shipped by every build, and the Particle screen to fill it. Add particle effects… puts .ypt files into a pack that is there"
msgstr "为项目添加粒子效果：在单独的文件夹中创建一个空包，每次构建都会包含它，并提供“粒子”界面来填充。“添加粒子效果…”会将 .ypt 文件放入已有的包中"

msgid "Give the project weapons: an empty pack in a folder of its own, shipped by every build, and the Weapons screen to fill it. Add weapons… puts weapons into a pack that is there"
msgstr "为项目添加武器：在单独的文件夹中创建一个空包，每次构建都会包含它，并提供“武器”界面来填充。“添加武器…”会将武器放入已有的包中"

msgid "Give the property a keyframe at time and value zero"
msgstr "为该属性在时间和值均为零处添加关键帧"

msgid "Go to end (End)"
msgstr "转到末尾 (End)"

msgid "Go to start (Home)"
msgstr "转到开头 (Home)"

msgid "Grid step in metres"
msgstr "栅格步长（米）"

msgid "Ground height in metres"
msgstr "地面高度（米）"

msgid "Guid"
msgstr "GUID"

msgid "Hide"
msgstr "隐藏"

msgid "Hide (ctrl-click to solo)"
msgstr "隐藏（Ctrl+单击可单独显示）"

msgid "Hold positions to the grid"
msgstr "将位置吸附到栅格"

msgid "Hold scales to a step"
msgstr "将缩放吸附到步长"

msgid "Hold turns to a step"
msgstr "将旋转吸附到步长"

msgid "Id {id}"
msgstr "ID {id}"

msgid "Identity"
msgstr "标识"

msgid "Imports into the maps the .ymap, .ytyp, models and textures you pick: each game file is made a source of the pack and joins the map set shown. Dropping them on the Map screen does the same"
msgstr "将所选的 .ymap、.ytyp、模型和纹理导入地图：每个游戏文件都会成为该包的一个源，并加入显示的地图集合。将它们拖放到“地图”界面上效果相同"

msgid "Imports into the particles the .ypt files you pick: each becomes a source of the pack, its effects as rules you can read and change and its textures as DDS files. A file the source form cannot hold is refused with the reason, and nothing of it is kept. Dropping them on the Particle screen does the same"
msgstr "将所选的 .ypt 文件导入粒子：每个文件都会成为该包的一个源，其效果保存为可阅读和修改的规则，其纹理保存为 DDS 文件。源格式无法容纳的文件会被拒绝并说明原因，且不会保留其任何内容。将它们拖放到“粒子”界面上效果相同"

msgid "Imports into the weapons the models, textures and weapon files you pick: each game file is decompiled into a source of the pack, the weapons a weapon file defines join the pack, and a model or a texture goes to the weapon whose file names it. Dropping them on the Weapons screen does the same"
msgstr "将所选的模型、纹理和武器文件导入武器：每个游戏文件都会反编译为该包的一个源，武器文件定义的武器会加入该包，模型或纹理会归入其文件所指名的武器。将它们拖放到“武器”界面上效果相同"

msgid "Interior"
msgstr "室内空间"

msgid "Invert the filter"
msgstr "反转筛选"

msgid "It places an interior"
msgstr "它放置了一个室内空间"

msgid "Its header and table of contents take {needed} bytes, and the file holds only {found}: it may have been copied in part."
msgstr "其文件头和目录占 {needed} 字节，而文件只有 {found}：它可能只复制了一部分。"

msgid "Keep the entity on the ground while it moves"
msgstr "移动时使实体保持在地面上"

msgid "Level of detail"
msgstr "细节层次"

msgid "Levels of detail"
msgstr "细节层次"

msgid "Live Evolutions of {name}"
msgstr "{name} 的实时演化"

msgid "Lock"
msgstr "锁定"

