msgid "Particle effects for the game: drop .ypt files, and OpenRage keeps each as a source of rules and textures you can read and change, checks the pack and makes a FiveM resource."
msgstr "游戏粒子效果：拖放 .ypt 文件，OpenRage 会将每个文件保存为包含可阅读和修改的规则与纹理的源，检查该包并生成 FiveM 资源。"

