msgid "Move the texture coordinates of the garment's models into the part of the texture they use, and cut every texture they sample to that part: the colour textures of the pack and the normal and specular maps embedded in the models. The part is the smallest aligned power-of-two part that holds the coordinates, so each texture is cut by copying whole blocks and none is encoded again, and a crop that would keep more than half of a texture is not made. The models and textures become new sources the garment names, and Undo names the old ones again"
msgstr "将服装模型的纹理坐标移到其所用的纹理区域内，并将它们采样的每个纹理裁剪到该区域：包括包中的颜色纹理，以及模型中嵌入的法线贴图和高光贴图。该区域是能容纳这些坐标的、对齐的最小 2 的幂区域，因此每个纹理都通过复制整块来裁剪，且不会重新编码；若裁剪后仍会保留纹理的一半以上，则不进行裁剪。模型和纹理会成为服装所引用的新源，“撤消”会让服装重新引用旧的源"

