msgid "Pick the memory the textures are to fit and Plan: each texture is given the size and format that lose the least picture per byte saved, instead of one cut for all. Nothing is written until Accept; a source is never changed in place, the garments name a lighter copy and Undo takes it back. A texture made from a picture is left, and the Log says why."
msgstr "选择纹理应适配的内存并单击“计划”：每个纹理都会获得每节省一字节损失画质最少的尺寸和格式，而不是对所有纹理采用统一的削减。在单击“接受”之前不会写入任何内容；源不会被就地更改，服装改为引用更轻的副本，“撤消”可将其撤回。由图片制作的纹理保持原样，“日志”会说明原因。"

msgid "Pick the memory the textures of the garments picked, or of the whole pack, are to fit: each texture is given the size and format that lose the least picture per byte saved, with the PSNR of every choice and the texture before and after side by side. Nothing is written until the plan is accepted; then the garments name lighter copies of the sources, and Undo takes it back"
msgstr "选择所选服装或整个包的纹理应适配的内存：每个纹理都会获得每节省一字节损失画质最少的尺寸和格式，并显示每项选择的 PSNR 以及该纹理优化前后的并排对比。在接受计划之前不会写入任何内容；之后服装会改为引用源的更轻副本，“撤消”可将其撤回"

msgid "Pick the plugin.json or the plugin.wasm of a plugin; its folder is copied into the plugins directory"
msgstr "选择插件的 plugin.json 或 plugin.wasm；其所在文件夹会被复制到插件目录"

msgid "Pick your gta5.exe to extract the keys — usually a few seconds. NG keys come from your own magic.dat beside the keys cache, else from the key snapshot bundled with OpenRage. The deferred archives will load automatically when extraction completes."
msgstr "选择你的 gta5.exe 以提取密钥——通常只需几秒。NG 密钥来自密钥缓存旁你自己的 magic.dat，否则来自 OpenRage 附带的密钥快照。提取完成后，延迟加载的归档将自动加载。"

