msgstr "着色器 {shader}，常量 {parameter}：缓冲区 {buffer}，偏移量 {offset}，{values}；其效果未声明它。"

msgid "Its effects are read in the background, and a GTA VI drawable then names its shaders and their parameters by them."
msgstr "其效果会在后台读取，之后 GTA VI 的 drawable 会以它们来命名其着色器及其参数。"

