msgstr "GTA VI 的 drawable 仅在其材质被编辑后才会写出，作为其独立的资源"

msgid "a GTA VI drawable opens only from a scan of the archive that holds it"
msgstr "GTA VI 的 drawable 只能从包含它的归档的扫描中打开"

msgid "The record at 0xD0 holds {surfaces} surfaces of {triangles} triangles in the drawable's frame, drawn over the model: they are no level of detail's geometry."
msgstr "0xD0 处的记录包含 {surfaces} 个曲面，共 {triangles} 个三角形，位于 drawable 的坐标系中，绘制在模型之上：它们不是任何细节层级的几何体。"

