msgstr "其物理层级：{groups} 个组，各位于一根骨骼上，以及 {children} 个子项，放置在其组的骨骼处，其中 {second} 个在复合体之外有自己的 bound；原型的质量为 {mass} 千克。"

msgid "{count} bound is listed by bone at 0x38; its frame was not measured, so it is not drawn."
msgid_plural "{count} bounds are listed by bone at 0x38; their frame was not measured, so they are not drawn."
msgstr[0] "0x38 处按骨骼列出了 {count} 个 bound；其坐标系未经测定，因此不绘制。"
msgstr[1] "0x38 处按骨骼列出了 {count} 个 bound；其坐标系未经测定，因此不绘制。"

