msgid_plural "{count} pairs of groups at 0x58, as GTA V's self-collision pairs."
msgstr[0] "0x58 处有 {count} 对组，同 GTA V 的自碰撞对。"
msgstr[1] "0x58 处有 {count} 对组，同 GTA V 的自碰撞对。"

