msgstr "扫描每个归档"

msgid "Scans each GTA VI archive under this folder in turn, as a job of the job list: an archive scanned before is read from its kept scan. Its bodies are then tallied by kind, archive by archive, and the bodies of a kind are listed across them."
msgstr "依次扫描此文件夹下的每个 GTA VI 归档，作为任务列表中的一项任务：之前扫描过的归档会从其保留的扫描结果读取。随后按类型、逐个归档统计其数据体，并跨归档列出某一类型的数据体。"

