msgid_plural "{count} GTA VI names held, {new} new; {labelled} bodies state their own name and {keys} texture keys are named"
msgstr[0] "已保留 {count} 个 GTA VI 名称，其中 {new} 个为新增；{labelled} 个数据体写明了自己的名称，{keys} 个纹理键已命名"
