msgstr "用每种部件的第一个来绘制武器，各自位于其骨骼上，取代武器自身的网格"

msgid "A mix of {count} track"
msgid_plural "A mix of {count} tracks"
msgstr[0] "{count} 条曲目的混音"
msgstr[1] "{count} 条曲目的混音"

msgid "exact"
msgstr "精确"

msgid "calibrated"
msgstr "已校准"

msgid "calibrated, {percent} % of its coded blocks through a slot not known"
msgstr "已校准，其已编码块中有 {percent}% 经由未知槽位"

msgid "Calibrating GTA VI texture decoding from the packs of {folder}"
msgstr "正在根据 {folder} 下的包校准 GTA VI 纹理解码"

msgid "A calibration of GTA VI texture decoding is already running"
msgstr "GTA VI 纹理解码的校准已在运行"

msgid "No GTA VI texture pack opens under that folder"
msgstr "该文件夹下没有可打开的 GTA VI 纹理包"

msgid "The calibration could not be kept: {why}"
msgstr "无法保存校准：{why}"

msgid "GTA VI texture calibration"
msgstr "GTA VI 纹理校准"

msgid "Calibrate decoding"
msgstr "校准解码"

msgid "Fit the tables of the console's texture coder from every pack of this game, so that the textures stored through it for BC3, BC4, BC5, BC6H and BC7 read. No file holds those tables, so such a texture is an estimate and is marked calibrated"
msgstr "根据此游戏的所有包拟合主机纹理编码器的表，以便读取经由它存储的 BC3、BC4、BC5、BC6H 和 BC7 纹理。没有任何文件包含这些表，因此此类纹理只是估算值，并标记为“已校准”"

msgid "Decode"
msgstr "解码"

msgid "Wrote {path}. This texture is {how}: an estimate, not the blocks the pack stores"
msgstr "已写入 {path}。此纹理{how}：这是估算值，并非包中存储的块"

msgid "{count} GTA VI texture pack calibrated: {bodies} coded mips now read as estimates, {unknown} % of their blocks through a slot not known"
msgid_plural "{count} GTA VI texture packs calibrated: {bodies} coded mips now read as estimates, {unknown} % of their blocks through a slot not known"
msgstr[0] "已校准 {count} 个 GTA VI 纹理包：{bodies} 个已编码的 mip 现作为估算值读取，其块中有 {unknown}% 经由未知槽位"
msgstr[1] "已校准 {count} 个 GTA VI 纹理包：{bodies} 个已编码的 mip 现作为估算值读取，其块中有 {unknown}% 经由未知槽位"

msgid "Filter by the model that uses a texture"
msgstr "按使用纹理的模型筛选"

msgid "Show only the textures used by a model whose name holds this text. A harvest of the game's names finds, for each texture, the first model whose material binds it"
msgstr "只显示名称包含此文本的模型所使用的纹理。对游戏名称的收集会为每张纹理找出第一个其材质绑定该纹理的模型"

msgid "used by {model} as {parameter}"
msgstr "由 {model} 用作 {parameter}"

msgid "used by {model} as {parameter}, and by {count} model more"
msgid_plural "used by {model} as {parameter}, and by {count} models more"
msgstr[0] "由 {model} 用作 {parameter}，另有 {count} 个模型也在使用"
msgstr[1] "由 {model} 用作 {parameter}，另有 {count} 个模型也在使用"

msgid "Use"
msgstr "用途"

msgid "Some textures of this game are stored through the console's coder and do not read yet. A calibration fits what they need from the game's own packs, once: about a quarter of an hour, which can be stopped and taken up again. They then read as estimates, marked calibrated"
msgstr "此游戏的部分纹理通过主机的编码器存储，目前尚无法读取。校准会根据游戏自身的包拟合所需的数据，只需一次：大约一刻钟，可以停止并在之后继续。此后这些纹理将作为估算值读取，并标记为已校准"

msgid "An estimate, not the exact picture: {how}"
msgstr "这是估算值，并非精确图像：{how}"

msgid "supplied tables, not checked"
msgstr "使用提供的表，未检查"

msgid "not this coder's tables"
msgstr "不是此编码器的表"

msgid "{count} of {blocks} coded blocks disagree with the supplied tables"
msgstr "{blocks} 个已编码块中有 {count} 个与提供的表不符"

msgid "The tables you supplied disagree with this pack: {count} of the coded blocks read so far read a value no table gives or hold what no encoder writes"
msgstr "提供的表与此包不符：目前已读取的已编码块中有 {count} 个读取了任何表都未给出的值，或包含任何编码器都不会写出的内容"

msgid "The tables you supplied are not checked against your packs: `openrage-cli ttpf tables --check` does that for the packs of a folder"
msgstr "提供的表尚未对照你的包进行检查：`openrage-cli ttpf tables --check` 可对某个文件夹中的包执行此检查"

msgid "A block that disagrees was not rebuilt as the pack stores it: the tables you supplied are wrong for it"
msgstr "不符的块没有按包中存储的样子重建：提供的表对它而言是错误的"

msgid "Not called exact: {how}"
msgstr "不称为精确：{how}"

msgid "Exact rests on the rules of this block format, which a wrong table breaks: none of this texture's {count} coded blocks breaks one, and neither did any of the {blocks} blocks of the format that a check read through the tables you supplied. The rules see an entry of a preset through the blocks that read it: whether it is in its place, a BC7 end's p-bit and the top bit of an anchor's index. They do not see each end value, nor an entry that few blocks read. No texture is stored both coded and plain, so no read is compared with the pack's own blocks"
msgstr "“精确”依据的是此块格式的规则，错误的表会违反这些规则：此纹理的 {count} 个已编码块无一违反规则，检查经由提供的表读取的 {blocks} 个该格式的块也无一违反。这些规则只能通过读取预设条目的块来查看该条目：它是否在其位置上、BC7 端点的 p 位以及锚点索引的最高位。它们看不出每个端点值，也看不出只有少数块读取的条目。没有纹理同时以编码和未编码两种形式存储，因此任何读取都不会与包自身的块进行比较"

msgid "supplied tables, no rule checks this format"
msgstr "使用提供的表，没有规则可检查此格式"

msgid "The tables you supplied are not this coder's: a check found {count} of {blocks} coded blocks that read a value no table gives or hold what no encoder writes. No texture read through them is the pack's"
msgstr "提供的表不是此编码器的表：检查发现，{blocks} 个已编码块中有 {count} 个读取了任何表都未给出的值，或包含任何编码器都不会写出的内容。经由这些表读取的纹理都不是包中的纹理"

msgid "A check of the tables you supplied held {bc6h} BC6H blocks and {bc7} BC7 blocks to the rules of their formats, and none broke one. No rule holds a BC1, BC3, BC4 or BC5 block"
msgstr "对提供的表的检查，已按各自格式的规则核对了 {bc6h} 个 BC6H 块和 {bc7} 个 BC7 块，没有任何块违反规则。BC1、BC3、BC4、BC5 块不受任何规则约束"

msgid "Exact rests on two tables: the tables you supplied and BC1's built-in ones give the same value for every preset slot and index symbol this texture reads. No texture is stored both coded and plain, so no read is compared with the pack's own blocks"
msgstr "“精确”依据的是两份表：对于此纹理读取的每个预设槽位和索引符号，提供的表与 BC1 的内置表给出相同的值。没有纹理同时以编码和未编码两种形式存储，因此任何读取都不会与包自身的块进行比较"

msgid "Read through the tables you supplied. None of this texture's coded blocks breaks a rule of its format, but one texture reads few of a preset's entries: the read is called exact only once `openrage-cli ttpf tables --check` has held the tables to the blocks of this format in a folder's packs"
msgstr "经由提供的表读取。此纹理的已编码块无一违反其格式的规则，但单个纹理只读取预设中的少数条目：只有在 `openrage-cli ttpf tables --check` 用某个文件夹的包中该格式的块核对这些表之后，才将此读取称为精确"

msgid "Read through the tables you supplied. No rule of this block format can show a wrong table and no second table is known, so nothing can confirm the read and it is not called exact"
msgstr "经由提供的表读取。此块格式没有任何规则能揭示错误的表，也没有已知的第二份表，因此无从确认此读取，不将其称为精确"

msgid "built-in BC1 tables, not confirmed"
msgstr "内置 BC1 表，未经确认"

msgid "plain levels read, coded levels not read"
msgstr "已读取未编码级别，未读取已编码级别"

msgid "a coded body not read, the levels above it read"
msgstr "有一个已编码部分未读取，其上的级别已读取"

msgid "The levels read are not all of this texture: a body of it stored through the coder was not read, so nothing is said of the levels that body holds, and the texture is not called exact"
msgstr "已读取的级别并非此纹理的全部：其中经由编码器存储的一个部分未被读取，因此对该部分所含的级别不作任何说明，也不将此纹理称为精确"

msgid "{count} coded blocks read a value the built-in BC1 tables give otherwise"
msgstr "{count} 个已编码块读取了内置 BC1 表给出不同值的表项"

msgid "BC1's built-in tables were fitted by their author and nothing confirms them value for value, so a read through them alone is not called exact. Through a tables file you supply, BC1 reads through that file, and a block is counted where the two tables give another value"
msgstr "BC1 的内置表由其作者拟合而成，没有任何依据逐值确认它们，因此仅经由内置表的读取不称为精确。经由你提供的表文件时，BC1 经由该文件读取，并在两份表给出不同值之处计入相应的块"

msgid "The blocks counted read a preset slot or an index symbol for which BC1's built-in tables give another value, or none. They were rebuilt through the tables you supplied, and no second table stands behind them"
msgstr "计入的块读取了内置 BC1 表给出不同值或未给出值的预设槽位或索引符号。它们经由你提供的表重建，没有第二份表为其佐证"

msgid "Stopped before it finished. The next calibration of this game goes on from where this one stopped"
msgstr "在完成前已停止。下次校准此游戏时将从这次停止的地方继续"

msgid "The fields below are the ones this GTA VI body's own table states. Names come from GTA VI's name snapshot; a name the snapshot holds only as a hash shows its hash."
msgstr "下方的字段是这个 GTA VI 主体自身的表所声明的字段。名称来自 GTA VI 的名称快照；快照中只以哈希保存的名称显示为其哈希。"

msgid "No schema is staged for this type, so the fields below are the ones the document itself carries. Names come from the public tables; a field the tables do not name shows its hash."
msgstr "此类型没有可用的架构，因此下方的字段是文档本身携带的字段。名称来自公开表；表中未命名的字段显示为其哈希。"

msgid "Network name: {name}"
msgstr "网络名称：{name}"

msgid "words from +0x00 to +0x48 as stored: {words}"
msgstr "从 +0x00 到 +0x48 按存储原样的字：{words}"

msgid "{count} mission state table, as the document now stands"
msgid_plural "{count} mission state tables, as the document now stands"
msgstr[0] "{count} 个任务状态表，按文档当前的样子显示"
msgstr[1] "{count} 个任务状态表，按文档当前的样子显示"

msgid "{name} is a volume, so it keeps its size, format and mips: its levels lie across its z-slabs."
msgstr "{name} 是体积纹理，因此保留其尺寸、格式和 mip：其各级分布在各个 z 切片中。"

msgid "The special links of the neighbouring cell {cell} were renumbered by an edit of another cell, whose save writes them: save that cell or undo its edit first."
msgstr "相邻单元 {cell} 的特殊链接已被另一个单元的编辑重新编号，由该单元的保存写入：请保存该单元，或先撤销其编辑。"

msgid "The special links of the neighbouring cell {cell} would be renumbered, but its body holds deletions of its own, which its own save writes: undo them first."
msgstr "相邻单元 {cell} 的特殊链接将被重新编号，但其数据体包含自身的删除，由其自身的保存写入：请先撤销这些删除。"

msgid "This cell's special links were renumbered by an edit of a neighbouring cell, whose save writes them: save that cell or undo its edit first."
msgstr "此单元的特殊链接已被相邻单元的编辑重新编号，由该单元的保存写入：请保存该单元，或先撤销其编辑。"

msgid "{count} special link of this cell ended in a record that went, and was deleted."
msgid_plural "{count} special links of this cell ended in a record that went, and were deleted."
msgstr[0] "此单元有 {count} 条特殊链接以已移除的记录为终点，已被删除。"
msgstr[1] "此单元有 {count} 条特殊链接以已移除的记录为终点，已被删除。"

msgid "The special links of {count} neighbouring cell were renumbered: a save of this cell writes its body beside it."
msgid_plural "The special links of {count} neighbouring cells were renumbered: a save of this cell writes their bodies beside it."
msgstr[0] "已重新编号 {count} 个相邻单元的特殊链接：保存此单元时会将其数据体写在旁边。"
msgstr[1] "已重新编号 {count} 个相邻单元的特殊链接：保存此单元时会将其数据体写在旁边。"

msgid "The body at {offset} does not read, so whether it names the map is not known: {why}"
msgstr "{offset} 处的数据体无法读取，因此不知道它是否指明该地图：{why}"

msgid "Looking for the maps linked to {map}"
msgstr "正在查找与 {map} 关联的地图"

msgid "Open the whole scan of {archive}: the maps that name this one as a parent, and its own parent map, are found among the bodies it lists."
msgstr "请打开 {archive} 的完整扫描：将此地图指为父级的地图及其自身的父级地图，会在其列出的数据体中找到。"

msgid "The entity was not added or removed: {why}"
msgstr "未添加或移除该实体：{why}"

msgid "A map changed or closed while the maps linked to it were read: make the edit again."
msgstr "读取与地图关联的地图时，该地图已更改或关闭：请重新进行此编辑。"

msgid "{edit}. The maps it renumbers are open as documents of their own, each with this edit as one step: {maps}"
msgstr "{edit}。它重新编号的地图已作为各自的文档打开，每个文档中此编辑为一步：{maps}"

msgid "The archetype holds no value {member}."
msgstr "该原型不含值 {member}。"

msgid "The archetype selected is not in its map types body's tree."
msgstr "所选原型不在其地图类型数据体的树中。"

msgid "This map types body holds no plain archetype to copy the layout of."
msgstr "此地图类型数据体中没有可复制其布局的普通原型。"

msgid "No GTA VI drawable is open to make an archetype of."
msgstr "没有打开可用于创建原型的 GTA VI drawable。"

msgid "lodDist, guid and flags take numbers"
msgstr "lodDist、guid 和 flags 需填写数字"

msgid "The name {name} is held by another archetype."
msgstr "名称 {name} 已被另一个原型使用。"

msgid "The edited map types body does not read back as one."
msgstr "编辑后的地图类型数据体无法按地图类型数据体读回。"

msgid "New archetype from a drawable"
msgstr "由 drawable 新建原型"

msgid "Add the archetype"
msgstr "添加原型"

msgid "Declares in the map types body of this entity's archetype an archetype of the drawable open, its names from the text, its box the drawable's, a seed to check, and its sphere the box's. Undo takes it back"
msgstr "在此实体原型所在的地图类型数据体中声明已打开的 drawable 的原型：名称取自文本，边界框取自 drawable（仅为待核对的初值），球体取自边界框。“撤消”可将其撤回"

msgid "Group {group}, array at 0x10 {head}"
msgstr "组 {group}，0x10 处的数组 {head}"

msgid "Clip {clip}, parameter {index}: points {points}, floats {floats}"
msgstr "剪辑 {clip}，参数 {index}：点 {points}，浮点数 {floats}"

msgid "Parameter object {index} of type {kind}: arrays at 0x10 {first} and 0x20 {second}"
msgstr "参数对象 {index}（类型 {kind}）：0x10 处的数组 {first}，0x20 处的数组 {second}"

msgid "Parameter object {index}, lists {lists}, hashes {hashes}"
msgstr "参数对象 {index}，列表 {lists}，哈希 {hashes}"

msgid "New track's id"
msgstr "新轨道的 ID"

msgid "Pairs: {count}"
msgstr "对：{count}"

msgid "New pair's key"
msgstr "新对的键"

msgid "Delete this pair"
msgstr "删除此对"

msgid "A GTA VI particle list takes a new emitter or particle rule only as a copy of one it holds: use Duplicate, and keep the copy's name the name of the rule it copies followed by _copy."
msgstr "GTA VI 粒子列表只接受新的发射器规则或粒子规则作为其已有规则的副本：请使用“创建副本”，并让副本的名称保持为所复制规则的名称后加 _copy。"

msgid "An event was added to an effect that holds none to copy: a GTA VI particle list takes a new event only as a copy of one of its effect's events, so use Duplicate on an event."
msgstr "向一个没有可复制事件的效果添加了事件：GTA VI 粒子列表只接受新事件作为其效果中某个事件的副本，因此请对事件使用“创建副本”。"

msgid "A rule was given a behaviour of a class no rule of the GTA VI particle list holds: a new behaviour is written only as a copy of one the list holds, so use Copy to rule."
msgstr "某条规则被赋予了 GTA VI 粒子列表中没有任何规则拥有的类的行为：新行为只能作为列表中某个行为的副本写入，因此请使用 Copy to rule。"

msgid "Only a geometry child's primitives and vertices are added or deleted."
msgstr "只有几何子项的基本体和顶点可以添加或删除。"

msgid "Delete primitive {primitive}"
msgstr "删除基本体 {primitive}"

msgid "Add triangle {primitive}"
msgstr "添加三角形 {primitive}"

msgid "Delete vertex {vertex}"
msgstr "删除顶点 {vertex}"

msgid "Add vertex {vertex}"
msgstr "添加顶点 {vertex}"

msgid "Delete child {child}"
msgstr "删除子项 {child}"

msgid "Copy child {child}"
msgstr "复制子项 {child}"

msgid "A drawable's lone bound keeps its type: the drawable points at its record."
msgstr "drawable 的单个 bound 保持其类型：drawable 指向它的记录。"

msgid "Give child {child} another type"
msgstr "更改子项 {child} 的类型"

msgid "This document has no file, so its collision is not reshaped."
msgstr "此文档没有文件，因此不会重塑其碰撞。"

msgid "The body read again holds other numbers of children, vertices or primitives than the collision's changes began from."
msgstr "重新读取的数据体中子项、顶点或基本体的数量与碰撞更改开始时不同。"

msgid "Sphere"
msgstr "球体"

msgid "Capsule"
msgstr "胶囊体"

msgid "Tapered capsule"
msgstr "锥形胶囊体"

msgid "Disc"
msgstr "圆盘"

msgid "Cylinder"
msgstr "圆柱体"

msgid "Add and delete collision"
msgstr "添加和删除碰撞"

msgid "A primitive or a vertex is added last and deleted where it stands, a new triangle linking to the triangles it shares an edge with; a lone bound's child is copied or deleted, a primitive child given another type. Save As writes the body as a loose resource."
msgstr "基本体或顶点添加在末尾，并在原处删除，新三角形会与共享一条边的三角形相连；独立 bound 的子项可以复制或删除，基本体子项可以改为另一种类型。“另存为”会将数据体写成独立资源。"

msgid "Copy the child"
msgstr "复制子项"

msgid "Delete the child"
msgstr "删除子项"

msgid "Delete the primitive"
msgstr "删除基本体"

msgid "Delete the vertex"
msgstr "删除顶点"

msgid "Add a vertex"
msgstr "添加顶点"

msgid "The file holds a collision change that was undone after it was saved, and a save does not take it out again: open the file again to edit it."
msgstr "文件中有一项保存后又撤销的碰撞更改，保存不会将其移除：请重新打开文件再编辑。"

msgid "Duplicate"
msgstr "创建副本"

msgid "Copy to rule…"
msgstr "复制到规则…"

msgid "(every other rule lists one of its class)"
msgstr "（其他每条规则都已有该类的一个行为）"

msgid "(the file holds no map here)"
msgstr "（此处文件不含键值对表）"

msgid "{size} bytes, halves at +0x00, +0x02 and +0x06 {first} {second} {fourth}, operators {operators}"
msgstr "{size} 字节，+0x00、+0x02 和 +0x06 处的半字 {first} {second} {fourth}，运算符 {operators}"

msgid "{words}, a curve over [{minimum}, {maximum}] with keys {keys}"
msgstr "{words}，区间 [{minimum}, {maximum}] 上的曲线，键为 {keys}"

msgid "Triangle"
msgstr "三角形"

msgid "Add the primitive"
msgstr "添加基本体"

msgid "Add primitive {primitive}"
msgstr "添加基本体 {primitive}"

msgid "A drawable's lone bound has no child added or deleted: the drawable points at its record."
msgstr "drawable 的单个 bound 不能添加或删除子项：drawable 指向它的记录。"

msgid "In a fragment each child of the composite is also a fragment child, so it is not added or deleted."
msgstr "在 fragment 中，composite 的每个子项也是 fragment 的子项，因此不能添加或删除。"

msgid "The elements do not read: {e}"
msgstr "无法读取这些元素：{e}"

msgid "at {at}: {class}"
msgstr "{at}：{class}"

msgid "{count} pair"
msgid_plural "{count} pairs"
msgstr[0] "{count} 个键值对"
msgstr[1] "{count} 个键值对"

msgid "Set the GTA VI folder in Settings ▸ Games to fly through its world"
msgstr "在“设置 ▸ 游戏”中设置 GTA VI 文件夹，即可漫游其世界"

msgid "The GTA VI world, flown through"
msgstr "GTA VI 世界漫游"

msgid "Indexing the GTA VI world: {percent} %"
msgstr "正在为 GTA VI 世界建立索引：{percent} %"

msgid "The GTA VI world was not indexed: {why}"
msgstr "未能为 GTA VI 世界建立索引：{why}"

msgid "Drag to look, W A S D or Z Q S D to move, E and C up and down, Shift faster; the wheel sets the speed: {speed} m/s"
msgstr "拖动以环顾，W A S D 或 Z Q S D 移动，E 和 C 上升和下降，Shift 加速；滚轮调整速度：{speed} m/s"

msgid "Streaming"
msgstr "流式加载"

msgid "{loaded} of {wanted} maps streamed in, {waiting} waited for; {nodes} entities and lists"
msgstr "已流式加载 {wanted} 个地图中的 {loaded} 个，{waiting} 个在等待；{nodes} 个实体和列表"

msgid "{seen} of {selected} instances in view, in {draws} draws"
msgstr "视野内 {selected} 个实例中的 {seen} 个，共 {draws} 次绘制"

msgid "{models} models on the device ({megabytes} MB), {waiting} waited for"
msgstr "显卡上有 {models} 个模型（{megabytes} MB），{waiting} 个在等待"

msgid "Lit by the game's own passes"
msgstr "由游戏自身的渲染通道照明"

msgid "Lit by the plain pass: no game shader pack is read"
msgstr "由普通通道照明：未读取游戏着色器包"

msgid "Camera position {axis}, in metres"
msgstr "相机位置 {axis}，单位为米"

msgid "Speed (m/s)"
msgstr "速度（m/s）"

msgid "How fast the camera flies, in metres a second"
msgstr "相机的移动速度，单位为米每秒"

msgid "Level-of-detail scale"
msgstr "细节层次缩放"

msgid "The scale every level-of-detail distance is multiplied by"
msgstr "每个细节层次距离所乘的缩放比例"

msgid "Build the index again"
msgstr "重新构建索引"

msgid "Read the registration documents and every map of the level again, and keep the index in place of the one kept"
msgstr "重新读取注册文档和关卡的每个地图，并保留此索引以取代原有索引"

msgid "Mount"
msgstr "挂载"

msgid "The registration documents and the level's maps are being read"
msgstr "正在读取注册文档和关卡的地图"

msgid "No index of this install"
msgstr "此安装没有索引"

msgid "{packs} packs; the level's change sets: {read} read, {unread} not readable"
msgstr "{packs} 个包；关卡的变更集：{read} 个已读取，{unread} 个无法读取"

msgid "{bound} archives bound to the {named} the level names"
msgstr "{bound} 个归档已匹配到关卡命名的 {named} 个"

msgid "{registered} of {maps} maps are the level's: {rest} stream at rest, {scripted} are script managed, {empty} hold nothing"
msgstr "{maps} 个地图中有 {registered} 个属于关卡：{rest} 个默认流式加载，{scripted} 个由脚本管理，{empty} 个不含任何内容"

msgid "{archetypes} archetypes, {models} models; {unread} bodies did not read"
msgstr "{archetypes} 个原型，{models} 个模型；{unread} 个数据体未能读取"

msgid "The GTA VI world is indexed: {maps} maps stream at rest, {archetypes} archetypes, {models} models"
msgstr "GTA VI 世界已建立索引：{maps} 个地图默认流式加载，{archetypes} 个原型，{models} 个模型"

msgid "Indexing the GTA VI world"
msgstr "正在为 GTA VI 世界建立索引"

msgid "World"
msgstr "世界"

msgid "GTA VI's world as the game streams it at rest, flown through with a free camera"
msgstr "游戏默认流式加载的 GTA VI 世界，以自由相机漫游"

msgid "World view"
msgstr "世界视图"

msgid "{textures} textures on the device, {unread} not read, {waiting} waited for"
msgstr "显卡上有 {textures} 个纹理，{unread} 个未能读取，{waiting} 个在等待"

msgid "Lights of {maps} maps: {placed} placed, {lod} level-of-detail, {distant} distant, {probes} reflection probes; {drawn} drawn"
msgstr "{maps} 个地图的灯光：{placed} 个已放置，{lod} 个细节层次，{distant} 个远景，{probes} 个反射探针；已绘制 {drawn} 个"

msgid "Capture"
msgstr "捕获"

msgid "Clean frame"
msgstr "纯净画面"

msgid "Draw the world alone over the whole window, with no line and no panel over it; Escape brings them back"
msgstr "在整个窗口中只绘制世界，上面不叠加任何行或面板；按 Esc 恢复"

msgid "Copy the camera"
msgstr "复制相机"

msgid "Copy where the camera stands and looks, as a line a shots script reads and the field below takes"
msgstr "将相机的位置和朝向复制为一行，截图脚本可读取该行，下方字段也可接受"

msgid "Paste a camera line, then press Enter"
msgstr "粘贴一行相机数据，然后按 Enter"

msgid "A camera line to jump to"
msgstr "要跳转到的相机行"

msgid "That is not a camera line: copy one with Copy the camera"
msgstr "这不是相机行：用“复制相机”复制一行"

msgid "Hour"
msgstr "小时"

msgid "The hour of the day: what is placed for some hours draws inside them, and the world is lit by its day at that hour"
msgstr "一天中的时刻：为某些时段放置的内容在这些时段内绘制，世界按该时刻的日光照明"

msgid "Story pack"
msgstr "故事包"

msgid "Stream the maps the story pack adds"
msgstr "流式加载故事包添加的地图"

msgid "Shared minigames"
msgstr "共享小游戏"

msgid "Stream the maps the shared minigames add"
msgstr "流式加载共享小游戏添加的地图"

msgid "The index holds no script-managed group"
msgstr "索引中没有由脚本管理的组"

msgid "The game's own groups"
msgstr "游戏自身的组"

msgid "Switch on the groups the game's world state switches on at this hour, in place of the ones chosen"
msgstr "启用游戏的世界状态在此时刻启用的组，取代所选的组"

msgid "Script-managed groups: {on} of {groups} on"
msgstr "由脚本管理的组：{groups} 个中已启用 {on} 个"

msgid "{story} maps are the story pack's and {minigames} the shared minigames'; {groups} script-managed groups"
msgstr "{story} 个地图属于故事包，{minigames} 个属于共享小游戏；{groups} 个由脚本管理的组"

msgid "Bound by block maps: no key snapshot was found"
msgstr "通过区块地图匹配：未找到密钥快照"

msgid "Bound by the archives' tables; {ciphered} of the level's change sets are ciphered"
msgstr "通过归档的表匹配；关卡的变更集中有 {ciphered} 个已加密"

msgid "In the interior {interior}, room {room}"
msgstr "在室内 {interior}，房间 {room}"

msgid "Time and weather"
msgstr "时间和天气"

msgid "What streams"
msgstr "流式加载的内容"

msgid "Go to"
msgstr "前往"

msgid "The game's own at this hour; a group ticked streams its maps in"
msgstr "此时刻游戏自身的组；勾选的组会流式加载其地图"

msgid "As you chose them; the hour no longer changes them"
msgstr "按你的选择；时刻不再改变它们"

msgid "Filter groups by name"
msgstr "按名称筛选组"

msgid "No group's name holds that text"
msgstr "没有组名包含该文本"

msgid "Look north over the square of 512 m where most maps whose names start with these letters lie"
msgstr "向北俯瞰名称以这些字母开头的地图最多的 512 米方格"

msgid "Look north over one of the squares of 512 m where most maps lie; once Harvest names has run, a place takes the letters its maps' names start with"
msgstr "向北俯瞰地图最多的 512 米方格之一；运行“收集名称”后，地点会以其地图名称的开头字母命名"

msgid "No GTA VI key snapshot was found, so the maps were bound by their block maps and no hour switches a script-managed group. Put gtavi_magic.dat in the configuration folder, or name it with OPENRAGE_GTA6_KEYS, then build the index again."
msgstr "未找到 GTA VI 密钥快照，因此地图通过区块地图匹配，且任何时刻都不会启用由脚本管理的组。将 gtavi_magic.dat 放入配置文件夹，或用 OPENRAGE_GTA6_KEYS 指定它，然后重新构建索引。"

msgid "The first visit reads every archive of the level, which takes a few minutes; the index is kept, so the next visit opens at once. Background jobs can stop it."
msgstr "首次访问会读取关卡的每个归档，需要几分钟；索引会被保留，因此下次访问会立即打开。可在“后台任务”中停止。"

msgid "{name}, {count} map"
msgid_plural "{name}, {count} maps"
msgstr[0] "{name}，{count} 个地图"
msgstr[1] "{name}，{count} 个地图"

msgid "Choose a place"
msgstr "选择地点"

msgid "Only what the data proves"
msgstr "仅数据证明的内容"

msgid "Leave out what a fresh game is taken to have beyond the data: requests of its scripts and the flags it starts with"
msgstr "不计入数据之外对新游戏的假定：其脚本的请求和开局时设置的标志"

msgid "{label} (inferred)"
msgstr "{label}（推断）"

msgid "GTA VI world index"
msgstr "GTA VI 世界索引"

msgid "no GTA VI files were found in {folder}. Settings ▸ Games must name the folder GTA VI is installed in, the one that holds its .rpf archives"
msgstr "在 {folder} 中未找到 GTA VI 的文件。“设置 ▸ 游戏”必须指定 GTA VI 的安装文件夹，即包含其 .rpf 归档的文件夹"

msgid "Still loading: {what}"
msgstr "仍在加载：{what}"

msgid "the ground and fog under the water"
msgstr "水下的地面和雾"

msgid "The level from above: the water, the land by its height, and the brighter, the more maps; click to look over a place"
msgstr "从上方看关卡：水面、按高度显示的陆地，越亮表示地图越多；点击以查看某处"

msgid "Click to look north over a place, from 250 m south of it"
msgstr "点击以从某处以南 250 米处向北俯瞰"

msgid "Over {name}, {height} m above the ground, looking {direction}"
msgstr "位于 {name} 上空，离地 {height} 米，朝向{direction}"

msgid "Over {name}, at {height} m, looking {direction}"
msgstr "位于 {name} 上空，高度 {height} 米，朝向{direction}"

msgid "{height} m above the ground, looking {direction}"
msgstr "离地 {height} 米，朝向{direction}"

msgid "At {height} m, looking {direction}"
msgstr "高度 {height} 米，朝向{direction}"

msgid "north-east"
msgstr "东北"

msgid "south-east"
msgstr "东南"

msgid "south-west"
msgstr "西南"

msgid "north-west"
msgstr "西北"

msgid "{count} map"
msgid_plural "{count} maps"
msgstr[0] "{count} 个地图"
msgstr[1] "{count} 个地图"

msgid "{count} model"
msgid_plural "{count} models"
msgstr[0] "{count} 个模型"
msgstr[1] "{count} 个模型"

msgid "the lights of {count} map"
msgid_plural "the lights of {count} maps"
msgstr[0] "{count} 个地图的灯光"
msgstr[1] "{count} 个地图的灯光"

msgid "The names of this document's strings need the GTA VI key snapshot"
msgstr "此文档字符串的名称需要 GTA VI 密钥快照"

msgid "Direct3D 12 is compiling shaders with FXC, because no dxcompiler.dll was found beside OpenRage, on PATH or in a Windows SDK. FXC refuses some GTA VI shader programs and takes minutes over others, so the models that need them are drawn in Material. Put dxcompiler.dll and dxil.dll beside openrage.exe, or start OpenRage with WGPU_BACKEND=vulkan."
msgstr "Direct3D 12 正在使用 FXC 编译着色器，因为在 OpenRage 旁边、PATH 中或 Windows SDK 中都没有找到 dxcompiler.dll。FXC 会拒绝部分 GTA VI 着色器程序，另一些则要花几分钟，因此需要它们的模型会以“材质”绘制。请将 dxcompiler.dll 和 dxil.dll 放在 openrage.exe 旁边，或使用 WGPU_BACKEND=vulkan 启动 OpenRage。"

msgid "Direct3D 12 is compiling shaders with FXC, which refuses some GTA VI shader programs, so the models that need them are drawn in Material. The Log says how to change that."
msgstr "Direct3D 12 正在使用 FXC 编译着色器，FXC 会拒绝部分 GTA VI 着色器程序，因此需要它们的模型会以“材质”绘制。“日志”中有更改的方法。"

msgid "It casts no shadow: one of its surfaces reads the view at an offset the light's view cannot be copied to"
msgstr "它不投射阴影：它的一个表面在无法复制光源视图的偏移处读取视图"

msgid "Only a document opened from a GTA VI archive is saved into a copy of it"
msgstr "只有从 GTA VI 归档打开的文档才会保存到该归档的副本中"

msgid "Cannot save into a copy of the archive: {reason}"
msgstr "无法保存到归档的副本：{reason}"

msgid "{file} is a new archive the same as the one it was read from: the edit writes the bytes the entry holds."
msgstr "{file} 是一个与读取来源相同的新归档：修改写入的是条目原有的字节。"

msgid "nothing this view holds is edited, or OpenRage writes none of its edits to a GTA VI body"
msgstr "此视图中没有任何修改，或者 OpenRage 不会将其任何修改写入 GTA VI 内容"

msgid "the copy is a new file, and the archive it is read from is never written"
msgstr "副本是一个新文件，读取来源的归档永远不会被写入"

msgid "more than one entry holds the body at {offset}, so which one to replace is not known"
msgstr "不止一个条目包含位于 {offset} 的内容，因此无法确定要替换哪一个"

msgid "no entry of the archive holds the body at {offset}"
msgstr "归档中没有条目包含位于 {offset} 的内容"

msgid "Save into a copy of the archive…"
msgstr "保存到归档的副本…"

msgid "No GTA VI keys: set the GTA VI install folder in Settings ▸ Games so its executable can unlock them."
msgstr "没有 GTA VI 密钥：请在 设置 ▸ 游戏 中设置 GTA VI 安装文件夹，以便其可执行文件解锁密钥。"

msgid "{file} is listed by a scan without its table: {why}"
msgstr "{file} 由扫描列出，没有使用其表：{why}"

msgid "{file} is a new archive with the edit in its entry's place and its table as it was read."
msgstr "{file} 是一个新归档，其条目位置已写入修改，其表与读取时相同。"

msgid "An EDUP body: its count word at 0x04 is {count}, and {length} payload bytes follow its 8-byte head."
msgstr "一个 EDUP 正文：其 0x04 处的计数字为 {count}，其 8 字节头之后跟随 {length} 字节的负载。"

msgid "With a count of zero, the word at 0x08 states {stated} bytes, and that many follow it."
msgstr "计数为零时，0x08 处的字注明 {stated} 字节，其后正好跟随这么多字节。"

msgid "Its payload is not read: no record width divides it by its count, and its bytes are of high entropy with no cipher record, so what it holds is not known and no view shows it."
msgstr "其负载未被读取：没有任何记录宽度能按其计数整除它，且其字节熵很高又没有加密记录，因此其内容未知，也没有视图显示它。"

msgid "Replace the lower levels of detail too"
msgstr "同时替换较低的细节级别"

msgid "Off, a level of detail the mesh names no geometry of is left as the model holds it. On, each such geometry takes the level-0 mesh at its model and place where both draw with one shader."
msgstr "关闭时，网格未指定任何几何体的细节级别保持模型中的原样。开启时，每个这样的几何体在其模型和位置上采用 0 级网格，前提是两者使用同一着色器绘制。"

msgid "In {place}"
msgstr "位于 {place}"

msgid "Look north over the square of 512 m where most maps of this place lie"
msgstr "向北俯瞰此地大多数地图所在的 512 米方格"

msgid "entry {entry} is not in this table"
msgstr "条目 {entry} 不在此表中"

msgid "Real size"
msgstr "实际大小"

msgid "Enciphered"
msgstr "已加密"

msgid "24 bytes"
msgstr "24 字节"

msgid "20 bytes, a headerless resource's"
msgstr "20 字节，无头资源的行"

msgid "Row"
msgstr "行"

msgid "Name hash"
msgstr "名称哈希"

msgid "{file} is a new archive with the tree's edits, which the game refuses because only its maker can sign the table they changed."
msgstr "{file} 是包含树中编辑的新归档，游戏会拒绝它，因为只有其制作者能签署这些编辑改动的表。"

msgid "the tree is no GTA VI archive opened on its own"
msgstr "此树不是单独打开的 GTA VI 归档"

msgid "an archive of the tree is no longer open"
msgstr "树中的一个归档已不再打开"

msgid "entry {index} states no start"
msgstr "条目 {index} 未说明起始位置"

msgid "{name} has no body of its own"
msgstr "{name} 没有自己的主体"

msgid "{name} is an archive moved in from another, which the GTA VI writer does not add"
msgstr "{name} 是从另一个归档移入的归档，GTA VI 写入器不会添加它"

msgid "{name} holds no bytes"
msgstr "{name} 不含任何字节"

msgid "list {list}: {entries}"
msgstr "列表 {list}：{entries}"

msgid "Add to the facial controls it writes"
msgstr "添加到它写入的面部控制中"

msgid "{count} byte over"
msgid_plural "{count} bytes over"
msgstr[0] "多出 {count} 字节"
msgstr[1] "多出 {count} 字节"

msgid "{count} byte short"
msgid_plural "{count} bytes short"
msgstr[0] "少了 {count} 字节"
msgstr[1] "少了 {count} 字节"

msgid "The edits to {file} save as a patched copy: each changed body is written in its entry's place, chunk by chunk, and the table stays byte-identical, so its signature still matches and no check read in the game's code rejects it; the game has not been run with it."
msgstr "对 {file} 的编辑保存为修补副本：每个更改的主体都逐块写在其条目的位置，表保持逐字节相同，因此其签名仍然匹配，游戏代码中读到的任何检查都不会拒绝它；尚未用它运行过游戏。"

msgid "The edits to {file} save as a rebuilt archive, which the game refuses because only its maker can sign the table."
msgstr "对 {file} 的编辑保存为重建的归档，游戏会拒绝它，因为只有其制作者能签名该表。"

msgid "These rows keep it from being patched in place: {rows}."
msgstr "以下行导致其无法原地修补：{rows}。"

msgid "No key opens the tables of these archives, so they are read by a scan: {why}"
msgstr "没有密钥能打开这些归档的表，因此通过扫描读取它们：{why}"

msgid "(keys found, {count} name held)"
msgid_plural "(keys found, {count} names held)"
msgstr[0] "（已找到密钥，持有 {count} 个名称）"
msgstr[1] "（已找到密钥，持有 {count} 个名称）"

msgid "(keys found, reading the names…)"
msgstr "（已找到密钥，正在读取名称…）"

msgid "(looking for the keys…)"
msgstr "（正在查找密钥…）"

msgid "(no keys: its archives are read by a scan)"
msgstr "（无密钥：其归档通过扫描读取）"

msgid "{folder} is {title}. Its archives open from their tables as folders of the tree."
msgstr "{folder} 是 {title}。其归档从各自的表打开，作为树中的文件夹。"

msgid "the decompiler stopped on a fault in this program"
msgstr "反编译器在此程序中因故障而停止"

msgid "This is a compiled GTA VI script that does not decompile, so it is shown as its bytes: {e}"
msgstr "这是一个无法反编译的 GTA VI 已编译脚本，因此显示为其字节：{e}"

msgid "{count} function"
msgid_plural "{count} functions"
msgstr[0] "{count} 个函数"
msgstr[1] "{count} 个函数"

msgid "{name}: {count} line from line {line}"
msgid_plural "{name}: {count} lines from line {line}"
msgstr[0] "{name}：从第 {line} 行起共 {count} 行"
msgstr[1] "{name}：从第 {line} 行起共 {count} 行"

msgid "{count} class"
msgid_plural "{count} classes"
msgstr[0] "{count} 个类"
msgstr[1] "{count} 个类"

msgid "The instructions of this function do not decode: {e}"
msgstr "无法解码此函数的指令：{e}"

msgid "Select a function in the outline to list its instructions"
msgstr "在大纲中选择一个函数以列出其指令"

msgid "{count} function has no body in the source"
msgid_plural "{count} functions have no body in the source"
msgstr[0] "{count} 个函数在源代码中没有函数体"
msgstr[1] "{count} 个函数在源代码中没有函数体"

msgid "{count} imported program"
msgid_plural "{count} imported programs"
msgstr[0] "{count} 个导入的程序"
msgstr[1] "{count} 个导入的程序"

msgid "Natives are named from {list}"
msgstr "原生函数按 {list} 命名"

msgid "Names are read from {lists}"
msgstr "名称读取自 {lists}"

msgid "No names list was supplied, so a type, a field or a method is shown by its hash or its offset"
msgstr "未提供名称列表，因此类型、字段或方法按其哈希或偏移显示"

msgid "Open names folder"
msgstr "打开名称文件夹"

msgid "The caret is on no name"
msgstr "插入点处没有名称"

msgid "{name} follows a dot: it may be defined in another program, and only a name that stands alone is followed"
msgstr "{name} 位于点号之后：它可能定义在其他程序中，只有单独出现的名称才能跳转"

msgid "This script defines no one thing called {name}"
msgstr "此脚本中名为 {name} 的定义并非恰好一个"

msgid "No GTA VI script is in front"
msgstr "当前最前面的不是 GTA VI 脚本"

msgid "Go to definition"
msgstr "转到定义"

msgid "Move the caret to where this script defines the name under it"
msgstr "将插入点移到此脚本定义其所在名称的位置"

msgid "Find references"
msgstr "查找引用"

msgid "Find every place of this script that spells the name under the caret"
msgstr "查找此脚本中写有插入点处名称的每个位置"

msgid "GTA VI Script"
msgstr "GTA VI 脚本"

msgid "A compiled GTA VI script, read from the archive that holds it or from a deciphered file: the source it decompiles to and the classes and functions that source lists, read-only"
msgstr "GTA VI 的已编译脚本，从包含它的归档或已解密的文件中读取：显示其反编译得到的源代码，以及该源代码列出的类和函数，只读"

msgid "a GTA VI script holds compiled bytecode; OpenRage reads one and does not write one"
msgstr "GTA VI 脚本包含已编译的字节码；OpenRage 只读取而不写入此类脚本"

msgid "No natives list was supplied, so a native is shown by the address of its handler, or by its hash where a names list gives the hash at that address"
msgstr "未提供原生函数列表，因此原生函数按其处理函数的地址显示；若名称列表给出了该地址对应的哈希，则按哈希显示"

msgid "No native is named from {lists}: a compiled program calls a native by the address of its handler, and a natives list names one only where a names list gives the hash at that address (a table of hash and rva)"
msgstr "没有原生函数按 {lists} 命名：已编译的程序通过处理函数的地址调用原生函数，只有名称列表给出该地址对应的哈希时（hash 和 rva 的表），原生函数列表才能为其命名"

msgid "Not read from the names folder: {files}"
msgstr "未从名称文件夹读取：{files}"

msgid "What other programs state of the types and functions this one uses is read from the project {file}"
msgstr "其他程序对本程序所用类型和函数的说明读取自项目 {file}"

msgid "Decompiled alone: a function that needs what another program states has no body. openrage-cli script export -o writes a project.json of every program of a build; put it in the names folder or beside this file, then open the script again"
msgstr "单独反编译：需要其他程序所述内容的函数没有函数体。openrage-cli script export -o 会写出一个构建中所有程序的 project.json；将其放入名称文件夹或此文件旁边，然后重新打开脚本"

msgid "A project file was found and not read: {why}"
msgstr "找到了项目文件但未读取：{why}"

msgid "Put names lists, natives lists and a project.json in this folder, then open the script again: OpenRage ships none. Each file is read as a names list where it reads as one, else as a natives list; a file whose name starts with natives, or that holds JSON, is tried as a natives list first"
msgstr "将名称列表、原生函数列表和 project.json 放入此文件夹，然后重新打开脚本：OpenRage 不附带任何一项。每个文件若能按名称列表读取则按名称列表读取，否则按原生函数列表读取；名称以 natives 开头或内容为 JSON 的文件会先按原生函数列表尝试"

msgid "Lifted listing"
msgstr "由字节码提升的清单"

msgid "Structured statements"
msgstr "结构化语句"

msgid "Source with classes"
msgstr "带类的源代码"

msgid "Decompiling, {seconds} s so far; functions to write: {functions}"
msgstr "正在反编译，已用 {seconds} 秒；待写出的函数：{functions}"

msgid "Stop waiting"
msgstr "停止等待"

msgid "A decompile cannot be stopped part-way: this stops waiting for it, the script keeps the source it has, and what the decompile writes is dropped when it ends"
msgstr "反编译无法中途停止：此操作只是不再等待它，脚本保留现有的源代码，反编译写出的内容会在其结束时丢弃"

msgid "{held} of {all} functions are decompiled. This program is large, so its source holds only the ones picked: click a function in the outline to add it"
msgstr "{all} 个函数中已反编译 {held} 个。此程序较大，因此其源代码只包含已选的函数：在大纲中单击一个函数即可添加"

msgid "Decompile every function"
msgstr "反编译所有函数"

msgid "Decompiles the whole program on a thread of its own. A program this large takes minutes"
msgstr "在单独的线程上反编译整个程序。这么大的程序需要数分钟"

msgid "The script was not decompiled: {e}"
msgstr "脚本未能反编译：{e}"

msgid "A key you chose, which no preset changes"
msgstr "你选择的按键，任何预设都不会更改它"

msgid "A set of keys for the commands it names: every other command keeps its key, and so does one whose key you chose. OpenRage is the set the app starts with."
msgstr "为其列出的命令提供的一组按键：其他命令保留各自的按键，你自己选过按键的命令也是如此。OpenRage 是应用启动时使用的那一组。"

msgid "CodeWalker"
msgstr "CodeWalker"

msgid "OpenRage"
msgstr "OpenRage"

msgid "Preset"
msgstr "预设"

msgid "{count} command it names keeps the key you chose."
msgid_plural "{count} commands it names keep the keys you chose."
msgstr[0] "其中 {count} 个命令保留你选择的按键。"
msgstr[1] "其中 {count} 个命令保留你选择的按键。"

msgid "{key} (US keyboard)"
msgstr "{key}（美式键盘）"

msgid "{preset} changes the keys of {count} command."
msgid_plural "{preset} changes the keys of {count} commands."
msgstr[0] "{preset} 更改了 {count} 个命令的按键。"
msgstr[1] "{preset} 更改了 {count} 个命令的按键。"

msgid "The world goes over to the weather chosen in a minute of the game's time, as the game's own weather changes"
msgstr "世界在游戏时间的一分钟内转为所选天气，与游戏自身的天气变化一样"

msgid "Not saved into its row: {reason}"
msgstr "未保存到其行中：{reason}"

msgid "{name} is saved into its row of {archive}, and the archive's Save as… writes it to a new file: a patched copy where the body fits its entry's chunks, else a rebuilt archive, which the game refuses because only its maker can sign the table."
msgstr "{name} 已保存到 {archive} 中它的行，该归档的“另存为…”会把它写入新文件：主体能放入其条目的块时为修补副本，否则为重建的归档，游戏会拒绝它，因为只有其制作者能签名该表。"

msgid "Save a copy"
msgstr "保存副本"

msgid "Save a patched copy"
msgstr "保存修补副本"

msgid "Save a rebuilt archive"
msgstr "保存重建的归档"

msgid "Nothing in {file} is edited, so the copy is the archive as it was read, byte for byte."
msgstr "{file} 中没有任何编辑，因此副本就是读取时的归档，逐字节相同。"

msgid "{file} is the archive as it was read, byte for byte: nothing in it is edited."
msgstr "{file} 就是读取时的归档，逐字节相同：其中没有任何编辑。"

msgid "Write the GTA VI document's edits in place of its entry, in a new copy of the archive it was read from: a patched copy, its table byte-identical, where the body fits its entry's chunks, which no check read in the game's code rejects though the game has not been run with it; else a rebuilt archive, which the game refuses because only its maker can sign the table"
msgstr "将 GTA VI 文档的编辑写在其条目的位置，写入读取它的归档的新副本：主体能放入其条目的块时为修补副本，其表逐字节相同，游戏代码中读到的任何检查都不会拒绝它，尽管尚未用它运行过游戏；否则为重建的归档，游戏会拒绝它，因为只有其制作者能签名该表"

msgid "The text table is laid out again at another length ({reason}), so a save into its archive writes a rebuilt archive, which the game refuses because only its maker can sign the table."
msgstr "文本表以另一长度重新排布（{reason}），因此保存到其归档会写出重建的归档，游戏会拒绝它，因为只有其制作者能签名该表。"

msgid "{name} does not read as a resource from its start"
msgstr "{name} 从其开头读不出资源"

msgid "{file} is a rebuilt archive with the document's edit, which the game refuses because only its maker can sign the table it changed."
msgstr "{file} 是带有该文档编辑的重建归档，游戏会拒绝它，因为只有其制作者能签名它所更改的表。"

msgid "In a GTA VI archive"
msgstr "在 GTA VI 归档中"

msgid "This key changes the length of its clip's data, so its archive will be saved rebuilt, which the game refuses because only its maker can sign the table."
msgstr "此关键帧会改变其剪辑数据的长度，因此其归档将以重建方式保存，游戏会拒绝它，因为只有其制作者能签名该表。"

msgid "its part's state {state} has a wrinkle map, and the number the game then sets to have its pixel program sample the map is not read"
msgstr "其部件的状态 {state} 带有皱纹贴图，而游戏随后为让其像素程序采样该贴图所设的数值尚未读出"

msgid "Drawn by their forward passes, laid over the lit frame before it is toned: {count} of those surfaces"
msgstr "由其前向通道绘制，在应用色调曲线之前叠加到已照明的画面上：其中 {count} 个表面"

msgid "The sun's shadow: the shadow map, since the traced pass does not run: {why}"
msgstr "太阳阴影：阴影贴图，因为光线追踪通道未运行：{why}"

msgid "The sun's shadow: the shadow map, while the traced pass is built"
msgstr "太阳阴影：阴影贴图，光线追踪通道仍在构建中"

msgid "The traced shadow is of the model at rest: a posed model's triangles are not computed on the CPU"
msgstr "追踪的阴影是模型静止时的：摆姿势的模型的三角形不在 CPU 上计算"

msgid "The sun's shadow: traced by GTA VI's own walk, translated, under the editor's rays in a compute pass; its cutout surfaces are traced solid"
msgstr "太阳阴影：由 GTA VI 自己的遍历（已翻译）在编辑器的光线下于计算通道中追踪；其镂空表面按实心追踪"

msgid "The traced walk tests each node by the device's ray query"
msgstr "追踪的遍历用显卡的光线查询测试每个节点"

msgid "The traced walk tests each node in software"
msgstr "追踪的遍历用软件测试每个节点"
